data: {"type":"response.completed","sequence_number":1878,"response":{"id":"resp_0c17af8fc60a9be3016adb51861c008191a60116d45178585b","object":"response","created_at":1792758150,"completed_at":1792758172,"status":"completed","background":false,"frequency_penalty":0.0,"presence_penalty":0.0,"moderation":null,"model":"gpt-6-luna","access_programs":null,"previous_response_id":null,"instructions":"Complete the supplied mathematical task using only its explicit inputs and tools. Submit the requested JSON artifact through structured submit_draft (preferred) or the compatible submit_artifact wrapper. Tool feedback is real task feedback; do not invent a successful check. This is a Yui workflow stage. Read the relevant declared Yui rules, preserve the supplied proof route and exact allowed assumptions, and distinguish mathematical review from structural checks.","output":[{"type":"reasoning","id":"rs_0c17af8fc60a9be3016adb518b9a1c819182544a6455a26cdc","summary":[],"content":[],"encrypted_content":"gAAAAABq21GL3Gocy2_6oQ_xHnj24zWbi436Ycw23jH8u_9ucoFdXe_pC7BqSqJQ6q9jAjIA8iE9gI1BEVZL-GqJ36wH2-7L6omr4FPlRfXYmZDUMiDdY4Cz8wo_Wpvp7Q1xpu9NT3IVjqPAkzJoh6dJZhqPg_4Pwhbra8muL0Q5vFNom6q9bkT7nQStz5LCdmlqZjRQlhnuowreR6lFjFBuoGlJ_hV1DEMeRKXuVfgHk0gn8dmWNiBcnGJGCz7jeqjT-AjaHxRZb2sBVRfjpsUi13A0-RpGpOsqRTvVEJrL-PAEaldZCAM4Bq9eoL8TYCVudRxXUeBPt6fwuOnNzXm5XTuiBt9fKNHzRi2AkH4mjmY9IqatkmTY-B2b4Yz_97h0S9cnTwQbpwtBY87J32jkd3tzlfhdn1tHIsOHh5Zsp2fNgiPkSrnMxJVu_L7sG6m3qp8O3HkJs0OPYA8YcrdUKrMm8kFX33BUjn9Qe821S10ccsDJL-Mqfvll6LXIyjspBPfz5KiC6I6mUedHfxHyRx6g3TJlw5cye2s1cnrBn-qnO6WMxk_0SDCgwemaBCBBcxBGwPyY45iB51hcx1WOSrjfGzxkKMtcKql8GDFA4hqkA7779ITWt3xCFwb4r50stkRFHsNz_bT3-mpkx-BFjujDg1wJeeBH7zQrQN_Yn_tm7F33Rw7fGDAdYkr53TFJ1xXKmOqL1e7Yw6QT2JN5sFBmMvRb_B7Lx5B91nsvbt50PhL-ra_UvebNYjCKMarM9UW7AASR6Q-VllZcL3TMN0DNacY-lfV8YhVlxngujl6v9NxM8qp41nURAQaIzPSYj2f1YozzcNBO32UxsevY25KS1x2msKRS-29hk_rOfZ8EhHrOhaobXcFXq8ttYYnlCr71Z8IDYYTcTScICWsiTYOkXAUm7XL3UpeEBSUK_E-hZxpRoL3pq4a7rC3Hm6xadh2gRJqP_htgImNbRtkHE27xFn9Xxm7jL